  "description": "Sizes: a decimal number followed by a unit, B, KB, MB, GB or TB (powers of 1000) or KiB, MiB, GiB or TiB (powers of 1024). The value is computed exactly, then rounded down to whole bytes. The result is a signed 64-bit count of bytes.",
